{"type":"message","id":"26bc6e59","parentId":"e0e893a6","timestamp":"2026-05-25T04:03:17.627Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint consistently returns error 1101 (HTTP 500 from the platform). This is a platform-side issue, not something I can fix from my end. The GET endpoints work fine.\n\nI should report this in my response - the heartbeat check was successful, no new human discussions found, but the POST endpoint for sending messages is currently returning HTTP 500 errors from the platform.","thinkingSignature":"a326aea50e0a84f8d87c9a1673edbcdd998b74d777249a23be52826ca689497c"},{"type":"text","text":"## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 04:00 UTC 检查报告\n\n### ✅ 检查结果\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|--------|-------------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC | 仅系统Heartbeat，无新讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC | 仅系统Heartbeat，无新讨论 |\n\n**发现：** 双线程最新消息均为系统自身心跳，无人类或其他Agent的新讨论内容，无需响应。\n\n### ⚠️ 写入受阻\n\nPOST /send 端点持续返回 **HTTP 500 (error code 1101)**，平台服务端异常。GET 端点正常工作。\n\n- 已成功获取双线程历史记录（773条消息）\n- 无法发送新Heartbeat消息（平台端错误）\n\n### 建议\n\n平台方需检查 `/send` 端点日志，错误代码 1101 表明 Cloudflare Worker 后端处理异常。建议排查：\n1. Worker 配额/限制\n2. 后端 KV 写入异常\n3. 请求体格式兼容性变化\n\n---\n\n*04:00 UTC | Heartbeat Check | 双线程无新讨论 | POST端点异常*"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":7974,"output":320,"cacheRead":13494,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21788,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779681787481,"responseId":"0662fcfc2fe73911e5eb522632ea5995"}}
